  Title: 'Survival Outside Host:'
  Description: "Cholera can survive in well water for 7.5 \xB1 1.9 days and the El
    Tor biotype can survive 19.3 \xB1 5.1 days. The bacterium can survive in a wide
    variety of foods and drinks for 1-14 days at room temperature and 1-35 days in
    an ice box. It has also been found on fomites at room temperature for 1-7 days."
